  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: October 2026</p>

  <p>Nimma Dinasi Angadi ("the Platform") is a grocery ordering platform for local Kirana stores. This policy explains what data we collect and how we use it.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account information</strong> — name, email address, and phone number when you sign up.</li>
    <li><strong>Order data</strong> — items ordered, order status, and timestamps.</li>
    <li><strong>Device data</strong> — browser type and push notification subscription (if you opt in).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To process and manage your orders.</li>
    <li>To send you order-related notifications and OTP emails for password reset.</li>
    <li>To allow store staff to fulfil your orders.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Data Storage</h2>
  <p>Your data is stored in Google Sheets associated with each store. Data is managed by the individual store owner and is not shared across stores or with third parties.</p>

  <h2>4. Push Notifications</h2>
  <p>Push notifications are optional. If you subscribe, your notification endpoint is stored to send you order updates. You can unsubscribe at any time through your browser settings.</p>

  <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>Your data is retained as long as your account exists. You may request deletion by contacting the store directly.</p>

  <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google</strong> — data storage (Google Sheets) and script execution (Google Apps Script).</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudinary</strong> — image hosting for product photos.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong> — hosting of this application.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>For any privacy-related questions, contact the store owner directly or reach us at <a href="mailto:support@nimmadinasi.in">support@nimmadinasi.in</a>.</p>
</body>
